{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑いですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日毎日やんなっちゃいますね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、早く冬になって欲しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/07/08/6313655/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、金魚飼いたいから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ夏でもいいかなぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のモバメを取って下さってる方は、私がどれだけ金魚欲しいかわかりますよね笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台版こちら葛飾区亀有公園前派出所の舞台成功を祈り、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"香取神社さんでお祈りしてきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/07/08/6313655/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/07/08/6313655/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"七夕という事で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏の舞台稽古と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツアーを乗り切るために"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"筋力が付きますようにって短冊に願い事を書きました(ง ˙ω˙)ว"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"筋トレする気力を保たないとね(ง ˙ω˙)ว"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私生駒里奈、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type